Tested up to: 5.4
License: GPLv2

Create a gallery of documents from a folder in your media library created with Real Media Library.

== Description ==

Insert a gallery of documents in a post or page from a folder in your media library created with [WordPress Real Media Library](https://devowl.io/wordpress-real-media-library/).

== Requirements =

This plugin is an add-on that allows you to use the following plugins together, which must be installed:

- [Document Gallery](https://wordpress.org/plugins/document-gallery/)
- [Real Media Library](https://devowl.io/go/codecanyon/real-media-library?source=document-gallery-for-real-media-library-wordpress-org)

== How to use it =

Watch the following video for a brief general introduction to [Document Gallery](https://wordpress.org/plugins/document-gallery/):

[youtube http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xb7RVzfeUUg]

Just install this plugin and you can use the following short code. The <code>rml_folder</code> attribute is the ID of the folder created with Real Media Library.

<code>[dg id=-1 rml_folder=28]</code>

**How do you get the folder ID?** Go to "Media" in your WordPress backend and select the folder you want to know the ID of. The URL in the address bar of your browser ends with "/wp-admin/upload.php?rml_folder=4". In this example the folder ID is 4.

*This plugin is a free micro add-on for Real Media Library with limited support.*

== Installation ==

1. Go to your WordPress backend
2. Navigate to "Plugins" > "Add New"
3. Search for "Document Gallery for Real Media Library"
4. Install and activate the plugin
5. Install [Document Gallery](https://wordpress.org/plugins/document-gallery/)
6. Install [Real Media Library from devowl.io](https://devowl.io/go/codecanyon/real-media-library?source=document-gallery-for-real-media-library-wordpress-org)
7. Let's insert a document gallery!

== Frequently Asked Questions ==
 
= Dose this add-on works with the free version of Real Media Library? =
 
Yes, you can also use the plugin with the free version of the Real Media Library, [available at wordpresss.org](https://wordpress.org/plugins/real-media-library-lite/).

